        "content": "{\n  \"quantitative_comparisons\": [\n    {\n      \"group_definitions\": {\n        \"d-FMT\": \"Donor Fecal Microbiota Transplantation (TACITO trial)\",\n        \"p-FMT\": \"Placebo Fecal Microbiota Transplantation (TACITO trial)\"\n      },\n      \"groups\": [\n        {\n          \"group\": \"d-FMT\",\n          \"value\": \"24.0 months\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"group\": \"p-FMT\",\n          \"value\": \"9.0 months\"\n        }\n      ],\n      \"result_or_measure\": \"Median Progression-Free Survival (mPFS)\",\n      \"setting_or_time\": \"Metastatic Renal Cell Carcinoma (mRCC), First-line Pembrolizumab + Axitinib, TACITO Phase 2a RCT\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"group_definitions\": {},\n      \"groups\": [],\n      \"result_or_measure\": \"12-month PFS Rate\",\n      \"setting_or_time\": \"Metastatic Renal Cell Carcinoma (mRCC), First-line Pembrolizumab + Axitinib, TACITO Phase 2a RCT\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"group_definitions\": {\n        \"d-FMT\": \"Donor FMT\",\n        \"p-FMT\": \"Placebo FMT\"\n      },\n      \"groups\": [\n        {\n          \"group\": \"d-FMT\",\n          \"value\": \"70%\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"group\": \"p-FMT\",\n          \"value\": \"41%\"\n        }\n      ],\n      \"result_or_measure\": \"12-month PFS Rate\",\n      \"setting_or_time\": \"Metastatic Renal Cell Carcinoma (mRCC), First-line Pembrolizumab + Axitinib, TACITO Phase 2a RCT\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"group_definitions\": {},\n      \"groups\": [],\n      \"result_or_measure\": \"Objective Response Rate (ORR)\",\n      \"setting_or_time\": \"Advanced Solid Cancers (Melanoma, HNSCC, RCC, MSI-H Pancreatic) progressing on ICIs, MITRIC Single-arm Phase IIa Trial\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"group_definitions\": {},\n      \"groups\": [\n        {\n          \"group\": \"MITRIC Cohort\",\n          \"value\": \"0%\"\n        }\n      ],\n      \"result_or_measure\": \"Objective Response Rate (ORR)\",\n      \"setting_or_time\": \"Advanced Solid Cancers (Melanoma, HNSCC, RCC, MSI-H Pancreatic) progressing on ICIs, MITRIC Single-arm Phase IIa Trial\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"group_definitions\": {},\n      \"groups\": [\n        {\n          \"group\": \"MIMic Cohort\",\n          \"value\": \"65%\"\n        }\n      ],\n      \"result_or_measure\": \"Objective Response Rate (ORR)\",\n      \"setting_or_time\": \"Advanced Melanoma, Anti-PD1 Monotherapy with Healthy Donor FMT, MIMIC Phase I Single-arm Trial\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"usable_content\": \"现有证据尚未证实微生物组干预在ICI治疗患者中的疗效已达到III期随机对照试验（RCT）确认的水平。目前找到的最高级别证据为两项II期研究，且结果存在显著的情境依赖性差异：\\n\\n1. **一线治疗场景（TACITO试验）**：这是一项针对转移性肾细胞癌（mRCC）患者的随机、双盲、安慰剂对照Phase 2a试验。虽然主要终点（12个月无进展生存率，d-FMT 70% vs p-FMT 41%, P=0.053）未达到统计学显著性，但次要终点中位PFS显著延长（24.0个月 vs 9.0个月, HR=0.50, P=0.035）。机制分析显示，特定菌株（如*Blautia wexlerae*）的定植与更好的PFS相关，而*Akkeermansia massiliensis*与较差的PFS相关。这表明在ICI初治患者中，FMT可能通过调节微生物群增强ICI联合TKI疗法的疗效，但尚需更大规模验证。\\n\\n2. **挽救治疗/耐药场景（MITRIC试验）**：这是一项单臂Phase IIa篮子试验，评估从ICI长期应答者捐赠粪便移植给ICI进展后的晚期实体瘤患者。结果显示FMT安全性良好，但临床活性有限：客观缓解率（ORR）为0%，中位PFS仅为1.5个月。机制上发现，基线髓系主导环境（高CD14+单核细胞和高IL-8）与不良预后相关，而激活的T细胞特征有利。这些免疫特征反映了宿主潜在的疾病状态，而非FMT直接改善的结果。此外，供体微生物群的定植在大多数接受者中是短暂的，仅在一例获得临床获益的患者中观察到持久定植。\\n\\n3. **早期探索（MIMIC试验）**：一项Phase I单臂试验显示，在晚期黑色素瘤患者中，健康供体FMT联合抗PD-1治疗可获得65%的ORR和较长的中位OS（52.8个月），但该研究样本量小且无对照组，仅为假设生成性数据。\\n\\n综上，目前缺乏已完成的、大规模III期RCT来确证微生物组干预的疗效。现有的阳性信号主要集中在ICI初治或特定生物标志物筛选的人群中，而在ICI耐药或广泛进展人群中效果不佳。\",\n  \"decision\": \"external_research\",\n  \"still_missing\": \"需要检索并确认是否存在已完成的、大规模的（通常指多中心、大样本量）III期随机对照试验（RCT），专门评估粪便微生物群移植（FMT）或定义明确的微生物菌群制剂联合免疫检查点抑制剂（ICI）在实体瘤患者中的疗效及其主要结局数据（如OS或PFS）。目前的材料仅包含Phase 2a或Phase I研究，无法满足“已完成的大型III期RCT”这一标准。\",\n  \"read_focus\": \"重点检索关键词：'Phase III randomized controlled trial fecal microbiota transplantation immune checkpoint inhibitor cancer', 'Phase III FMT oncology RCT results', 'completed Phase III microbiome intervention immunotherapy'. 特别关注TACITO试验后续是否有III期扩展，或其他大型药企主导的III期临床试验注册结果或发表文献。\",\n  \"external_ask\": \"请提供关于‘已完成的大规模III期随机对照试验证实微生物组干预在ICI治疗患者中的疗效’的具体证据。如果不存在这样的试验，请确认截至当前文献库中是否有任何III期RCT完成并报告了主要终点结果，或者明确指出此类试验尚未完成/未发表。\",\n  \"reason\": \"用户问题明确要求识别“已完成的、大规模随机对照III期试验”。提供的材料中，TACITO是Phase 2a RCT，MITRIC是Phase IIa单臂试验，MIMIC是Phase I单臂试验。虽然TACITO提供了重要的机制和II期疗效信号，但它不符合III期的设计标准和完成状态要求。因此，核心问题未被解决，需要外部检索来确认是否存在符合定义的III期RCT。\"\n}",
        "reasoning_content": "Here's a thinking process:\n\n1.  **Analyze User Input:**\n    *   **Role/Task:** Review author's material reading assistant. Extract specific research insights around a writing question.\n    *   **Input Data:** `material_found` (5 items, mostly planning summaries and direct evidence from 3 papers: MITRIC trial, TACITO trial, MIMic trial), `paper_context` (summaries of the same 3 papers), `question`: \"是否存在已完成的、大规模随机对照 III 期试验证实微生物组干预在 ICI 治疗患者中的疗效？\" (Are there completed, large-scale randomized controlled Phase III trials confirming the efficacy of microbiome interventions in patients treated with ICIs?)\n    *   **Constraints & Rules:**\n        *   Focus on `user_scope` (mechanism/context of how gut microbiome modulates ICI efficacy) but answer the specific question.\n        *   Keep research objects, settings, comparisons, methods, results, validation, boundaries.\n        *   Do not extrapolate without basis. Distinguish correlation from causation. Methods don't prove causality unless stated.\n        *   Output format: JSON with fields: `quantitative_comparisons`, `usable_content`, `decision`, `still_missing`, `read_focus`, `external_ask`, `reason`.\n        *   `quantitative_comparisons`: List each group/result pair exactly as in text. Format: `[{group: name, value: number+unit}]`. Keep order. Define abbreviations separately if needed. Record `reported_statistics`.\n        *   `usable_content`: Readable paragraph summarizing findings, differences, explanations, conditions. Start with distinguishing findings, end with them. No generic conclusions first. Don't merge different settings into one universal mechanism. Explain numbers, don't just repeat them.\n        *   `decision`: `direct_use`, `local_deep_read`, or `external_research`. Judge if the *specific question* is answered. The question asks for *completed, large-scale Phase III RCTs*. The materials provided are Phase IIa (MITRIC, TACITO) and Phase I (MIMic). None are Phase III. So the question is *not* answered by these materials. Decision should be `external_research` or `local_deep_read`? Actually, the materials explicitly state they are Phase IIa/I and do not meet the Phase III criterion. The gap is clearly identified in the auxiliary materials. I will choose `external_research` because the core requirement (Phase III RCT data) is missing from the current set, and I need to specify what to look for next. Or `local_deep_read` if I need to check other parts? The prompt says \"reading_mode=initial_read\". I'll stick with `external_research` as the primary decision, but I can also note that the current materials explicitly address the lack of Phase III data. Wait, the rule says: \"对于“是否已经有某类研究/结果”的问题，找到一个符合条件的实例可以回答；几篇论文未提到，或一篇较早综述说当时没有，不能回答当前是否存在。\" Since none of the found materials are Phase III, and they explicitly discuss their phase, I cannot confirm existence based on this set. I must request external search for Phase III trials.\n        *   `still_missing`: What's needed to answer the question.\n        *   `read_focus`: If local deep read is needed.\n        *   `external_ask`: Narrow request for external search.\n        *   `reason`: Justification.\n\n2.  **Extract Quantitative Comparisons:**\n    *   From TACITO trial (Phase 2a RCT):\n        *   Group: d-FMT (donor FMT), Result: 70% (12-month PFS rate), Setting: mRCC, first-line pembrolizumab + axitinib\n        *   Group: p-FMT (placebo FMT), Result: 41% (12-month PFS rate), Setting: same\n        *   Group: d-FMT, Result: 24.0 months (median PFS), Setting: same\n        *   Group: p-FMT, Result: 9.0 months (median PFS), Setting: same\n        *   Group: d-FMT, Result: 41.0 months (median OS), Setting: same\n        *   Group: p-FMT, Result: 28.3 months (median OS), Setting: same\n        *   Statistics: Primary endpoint P=0.053; median PFS HR=0.50, P=0.035; OS P=0.167.\n    *   From MITRIC trial (Phase IIa single-arm basket):\n        *   Group: Overall cohort (n=12), Result: ORR 0%, median PFS 1.5 months, median OS 10.1 months\n        *   Group: Single responder (melanoma), Result: Stable disease >6 months, alive at 33 months\n        *   Group: HNSCC patient, Result: Stable disease 20 weeks, alive at 16 months\n    *   From MIMic trial (Phase I single-arm):\n        *   Group: Overall cohort (n=20), Result: ORR 65%, median PFS 29.6 months, median OS 52.8 months\n    *   I will structure these carefully according to the prompt's format. Note: The prompt asks for `groups: [{group:原文组名或缩写,value:紧邻该组的结果含单位}]`. I'll list them precisely.\n    *   Let's draft `quantitative_comparisons`:\n        ```json\n        [\n  {\n    \"research_object\": \"TACITO试验(mRCC一线联合治疗)\",\n    \"result_or_measure\": \"12个月PFS率\",\n    \"setting_or_time\": \"d-FMT组 vs p-FMT组\",\n    \"groups\": [\n      {\n        \"group\": \"d-FMT\",\n        \"value\": \"70%\"\n      },\n      {\n        \"group\": \"p-FMT\",\n        \"value\": \"41%\"\n      }\n    ]\n  },\n  {\n    \"research_object\": \"TACITO试验(mRCC一线联合治疗)\",\n    \"result_or_measure\": \"中位PFS\",\n    \"setting_or_time\": \"d-FMT组 vs p-FMT组\",\n    \"groups\": [\n      {\n        \"group\": \"d-FMT\",\n        \"value\": \"24.0个月\"\n      },\n      {\n        \"group\": \"p-FMT\",\n        \"value\": \"9.0个月\"\n      }\n    ]\n  },\n  {\n    \"research_object\": \"TACITO试验(mRCC一线联合治疗)\",\n    \"result_or_measure\": \"中位OS\",\n    \"setting_or_time\": \"d-FMT组 vs p-FMT组\",\n    \"groups\": [\n      {\n        \"group\": \"d-FMT\",\n        \"value\": \"41.0个月\"\n      },\n      {\n        \"group\": \"p-FMT\",\n        \"value\": \"28.3个月\"\n      }\n    ]\n  },\n  {\n    \"research_object\": \"MITRIC试验(ICI耐药实体瘤)\",\n    \"result_or_measure\": \"ORR/中位PFS/中位OS\",\n    \"setting_or_time\": \"总体队列(n=12)\",\n    \"groups\": [\n      {\n        \"group\": \"总体\",\n        \"value\": \"ORR 0%/1.5个月/10.1个月\"\n      }\n    ]\n  },\n  {\n    \"research_object\": \"MIMic试验(晚期黑色素瘤)\",\n    \"result_or_measure\": \"ORR/中位PFS/中位OS\",\n    \"setting_or_time\": \"总体队列(n=20)\",\n    \"groups\": [\n      {\n        \"group\": \"总体\",\n        \"value\": \"ORR 65%/29.6个月/52.8个月\"\n      }\n    ]\n  }\n]\n        ```\n        Wait, the prompt says: `groups 是 [{group:原文组名或缩写,value:紧邻该组的结果含单位}]`. I should keep it simple. Also, `reported_statistics` needs to be recorded. I'll add it to the quantitative block or separately? The prompt says: `reported_statistics 记录原文给出的统计量（没报告才留空）`. I'll put it in the quantitative object or as a separate field? The prompt says \"逐字读取每个组名紧随的数值... reported_statistics 记录原文给出的统计量\". I'll include it within each item or as a separate array. I'll follow the exact structure requested. Actually, the prompt says: `quantitative_comparisons（无数字则 []）`. I will structure each item with the required keys. I'll add `reported_statistics` inside each item or as a top-level key? The prompt lists fields in order: `quantitative_comparisons`, `usable_content`, `decision`, `still_missing`, `read_focus`, `external_ask`, `reason`. I'll put `reported_statistics` inside the `quantitative_comparisons` array items or as a separate field if allowed, but I'll stick to the requested keys. I'll add it to each comparison item.\n\n        Let's refine `quantitative_comparisons`:\n        ```json\n        [\n  {\n    \"research_object\": \"TACITO试验(mRCC一线帕博利珠单抗+阿昔替尼)\",\n    \"result_or_measure\": \"12个月PFS率\",\n    \"setting_or_time\": \"随机分组\",\n    \"groups\": [\n      {\n        \"group\": \"d-FMT\",\n        \"value\": \"70%\"\n      },\n      {\n        \"group\": \"p-FMT\",\n        \"value\": \"41%\"\n      }\n    ],\n    \"reported_statistics\": \"P = 0.053\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"research_object\": \"TACITO试验(mRCC一线帕博利珠单抗+阿昔替尼)\",\n    \"result_or_measure\": \"中位PFS\",\n    \"setting_or_time\": \"随机分组\",\n    \"groups\": [\n      {\n        \"group\": \"d-FMT\",\n        \"value\": \"24.0个月\"\n      },\n      {\n        \"group\": \"p-FMT\",\n        \"value\": \"9.0个月\"\n      }\n    ],\n    \"reported_statistics\": \"HR = 0.50, P = 0.035\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"research_object\": \"TACITO试验(mRCC一线帕博利珠单抗+阿昔替尼)\",\n    \"result_or_measure\": \"中位OS\",\n    \"setting_or_time\": \"随机分组\",\n    \"groups\": [\n      {\n        \"group\": \"d-FMT\",\n        \"value\": \"41.0个月\"\n      },\n      {\n        \"group\": \"p-FMT\",\n        \"value\": \"28.3个月\"\n      }\n    ],\n    \"reported_statistics\": \"P = 0.167\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"research_object\": \"MITRIC试验(ICI耐药实体瘤)\",\n    \"result_or_measure\": \"ORR/中位PFS/中位OS\",\n    \"setting_or_time\": \"单臂篮子试验(n=12)\",\n    \"groups\": [\n      {\n        \"group\": \"总体\",\n        \"value\": \"ORR 0%/1.5个月/10.1个月\"\n      }\n    ],\n    \"reported_statistics\": \"\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"research_object\": \"MIMic试验(晚期黑色素瘤)\",\n    \"result_or_measure\": \"ORR/中位PFS/中位OS\",\n    \"setting_or_time\": \"单臂I期试验(n=20)\",\n    \"groups\": [\n      {\n        \"group\": \"总体\",\n        \"value\": \"ORR 65%/29.6个月/52.8个月\"\n      }\n    ],\n    \"reported_statistics\": \"\"\n  }\n]\n        ```\n        Check constraints: \"一组一数成对，不用多组名字对应一串数字；总体与分层比较、不同指标或结果分别记录。\" My structure matches this. I'll adjust slightly to ensure strict compliance.\n\n3.  **Draft `usable_content`:**\n    *   Need to synthesize findings relevant to the question (existence of Phase III RCTs) and the scope (microbiome modulation of ICI efficacy).\n    *   Current materials only contain Phase I and Phase IIa trials. They show mixed/limited efficacy signals: TACITO (Phase 2a RCT) showed significant median PFS improvement (24.0 vs 9.0 months) but missed the primary 12-month PFS rate endpoint (70% vs 41%, P=0.053) and did not reach statistical significance for OS (41.0 vs 28.3 months, P=0.167). MITRIC (Phase IIa single-arm) in ICI-refractory solid tumors showed no objective responses (ORR 0%) and short PFS (1.5 months), suggesting limited efficacy in heavily pretreated, rapidly progressive disease. MIMic (Phase I single-arm) in treatment-naïve melanoma reported high ORR (65%) and prolonged survival, but lacks a control arm.\n    *   Mechanistic/contextual insights from these early-phase studies indicate that clinical benefit appears highly context-dependent: donor selection (ICI responders vs healthy), timing (first-line vs refractory), disease progression speed, and microbial engraftment durability matter. Transient engraftment was common except in the single long-term responder in MITRIC. Immune signatures (e.g., activated T-cell vs myeloid-dominant) correlated with outcomes but reflected baseline host states rather than being directly modified by FMT to cause efficacy.\n    *   Crucially, none of the provided materials report completed Phase III RCTs. The literature base currently stops at Phase IIa/I, highlighting that while mechanistic hypotheses and early signals exist, definitive large-scale randomized confirmation remains unmet.\n    *   Structure `usable_content`: Start with the distinction in trial phases and outcomes -> Detail the specific results per setting -> Explain contextual/mechanistic factors noted -> Conclude with the explicit absence of Phase III data matching the query. Ensure tone matches academic review drafting. Avoid overgeneralizing. Keep it readable.\n\n    Draft:\n    现有材料仅涵盖Ⅰ期至Ⅱa期临床试验，尚未提供已完成的Ⅲ期随机对照试验数据。在研究设置与疗效信号上呈现明显分化：TACITO试验（Ⅱa期双盲安慰剂对照RCT，mRCC一线联合治疗）显示供体FMT组中位PFS显著长于安慰剂组（24.0个月 vs 9.0个月），但未能达到预设的12个月PFS率主要终点（70% vs 41%，P=0.053），且中位OS改善未达到统计学意义（41.0个月 vs 28.3个月，P=0.167）。相比之下，MITRIC试验（Ⅱa期单臂篮子试验，ICI耐药实体瘤）在重度预处理、快速进展人群中未观察到客观缓解（ORR 0%），中位PFS仅1.5个月，仅1例患者获得长期疾病稳定。MIMic试验（Ⅰ期单臂，初治晚期黑色素瘤）报告了较高的ORR（65%）与较长的生存期，但因缺乏对照臂无法排除选择偏倚。机制与适用边界方面，早期探索提示微生物组干预的疗效高度依赖临床情境：供体来源（ICI应答者与健康供体）、给药时机（一线vs耐药后挽救）、肿瘤进展速度及菌群定植持久性均影响结局；MITRIC中观察到的免疫表型差异（如活化T细胞特征有利、髓系主导/IL-8升高预后差）更多反映宿主基线疾病状态而非FMT直接诱导的因果改变。综上，当前证据停留在早期信号验证与机制假设阶段，尚未有完成的大规模Ⅲ期RCT证实微生物组干预在ICI治疗人群中的确切疗效。\n\n4.  **Determine `decision`, `still_missing`, `read_focus`, `external_ask`, `reason`:**\n    *   `decision`: `external_research